{"crw-nogi-25146":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台『すべての犬は天国へ行く』\n観てきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなすごかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/0880869/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして面白かった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんが生ドルで\n何回か見た方がいいって言ってたけど\n確かに！と思った(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと難しいからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもキャラクターがはっきりしてて\nすんなり入ってきたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなそれぞれ役にあってて\n見てて本当に楽しかった＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観に行けて良かった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/0880869/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな初日お疲れさま！\n公演数たくさんあるけどがんばれ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/0880869/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パナソニック充電池\n「乃木坂46応援力チャージプロジェクト」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://panasonic.jp/battery/charge/nogizaka46/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたいことに\n撮影に参加させてもらってます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏、えりかさま、生駒ちゃん、飛鳥、ひめたん、中田\nの6人の中に中田がいます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぅぅぅぅうううううういえええぇぇぇぇええええい！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はペンライトめっちゃ使うし\n充電池のありがたみも\nみんなよりわかってるので\n本当に嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/0880869/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12thシングルの制服着てますけど\n中田は普段大人メンバーの方を着てるのに\n若いメンバーのを着てる写メが\n何回か送られてきて\n「ん？なんで中田こっちの衣装着てるんだ？」\nって思ってた方いましたけど\nこの撮影で着たんですね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/0880869/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理由は単純に統一感ですね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"限定ムービーや\nライブが当たるキャンペーンもあるので\n是非チェックしてみてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/0880869/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユニット名思いつきました？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/0880869/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-18397":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『デスブログ　劇場版』の初日舞台挨拶イベントの詳細が決まりましたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５月２４日(土)\n開場　15:15　上映　15:30～\nシネマート六本木にて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は\n共演してくださった方々や\n監督さんも登壇してくださいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、愛未が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完成披露の舞台挨拶より\n初日舞台挨拶の方が緊張する"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってたから\nもうすでに不安だなー＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/11/3460010/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チケットぴあ先行プレリザーブ受付\n始まってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/11/3460010/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってるよ～＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/11/3460010/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福神漬け！\n着色料のついてないやつ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/11/3460010/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お店だと\nはなまるうどんのサラダうどん\nサブウェイ\nスープストック\nが好き！！よく行く！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ誤字あった～(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"× 7月13日（日）幕張個別握手会\n○ 7月13日（日）横浜個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/11/3460010/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事なとこだったから\nみんな気をつけてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/11/3460010/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前みさみさブログに登場させてもらったから\n中田ブログにも(*゜▽゜)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-13773":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/08/26/2651838/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここ見てくださった方 有難うー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時、ひなちゃんが何をやってるのかわからなくて、何してるんだろー？って、後ろの貼り紙見たりしてめっちゃ頭の中「？？？」で撮られてました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここだったんだねー＾＾ｗｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後pさんからつけてもらったあだ名は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「みせかけ天使」でした～(* ^o^ *)おい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後pによると、私は「見た目は天使だけど、中身がぶっ飛んでる」らしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合ってる？？(´･_･`)ｗｗｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天使は嬉しいけど、みせかけって何だよーっｗｗｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後pとはねー、よく2人で遊ぶくらい仲良いんだよー(´,,･ω･,,`) ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に庭園に行ったり、深川巡りをしたり、アニメ関係のとこ行ったりね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の趣味を唯一理解してくれるメンバーかもしれない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、夜更かし仲間だよね（笑）眠れなくなって、ひなちゃんに連絡すると100%返事返してくれるっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また今度遊ぼー(* ^^ *)♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、あるお仕事をしてきたんだけど、もおめっちゃくちゃ幸せでした～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また近くなったら、お知らせするのでお楽しみにー＼( ^o^ )／わーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チャイナ（ミ＾o＾ミ）＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/08/26/2651838/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てへっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/08/26/2651838/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねむい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-10696":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はひな祭りだよー\n女の子の日です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お昼にちらし寿司と\n桜餅といちご大福食べた。\nいちご大福さまさまさま！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毛糸や布で三つ編みするだけで\nかわいくみえる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レースとかビーズとか\nスパンコールとか...\nものづくり楽しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ぐわっ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だーれだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今から大量質問回答～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな男の子の服装はー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私自身、シャツが好きだから\n着てたらいいなって思います。\nシャツにゆるいのとか良いですね。\nあと、靴下がかわいかったり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなお菓子教えてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今和菓子めっちゃすき♪\nあと干し梅のお菓子とか\n昔からずっとすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかが思う乃木坂のメンバーで\n１番マイペースなのは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とまと！\nあえてまいまいと言わない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいはマイペースなのかな。\n天然ふわーんて感じ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握とか個握、何回か行っても\n大丈夫？困ったりしない？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで困るんだ！\n嬉しいに決まってるじゃないか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アジカンのライブいったことある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はライブとか行ったことないの。\nはあー行きたいなあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柔道してる人どう思いますか!?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強そう！かっこいい。\n私、空手少しやったことあるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやってないに近いけどね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際に定期とケーキ\n間違えたことある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際駅でケーキ片手に持ち歩く人\nいるのかしら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...え？私？...私のことなの？！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん？ゲラって何？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょーもないことで\n大笑いしてしまう人。\nそのままツボにはまって\n笑い続けるひとのことだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は春から高校１年生に\nなるんですけど、万理華ちゃんは、\n初めの自己紹介ってどんな感じで\nやりましたか？覚えていなかったら、\nアドバイス下さい！(^^)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わあ、思い出したら懐かしい。\nあの頃の髪型、おでこあげて\nポニーテールだったんだよな...\n私はさらっと言って終わった！\n(クールキャラ狙って)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの頃の第一印象を友達に聞いたら\n「大人しそう」「頭良さそう」\n「新体操習ってそう」でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふは\nクールどこ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2年のときなんて\n「1年から来ました」で\n大コケしたからね笑\n私のは参考にならないのばっかだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハキハキしゃべるのが一番"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私みたいにキャラ作ったら\n失敗する可能性が高いので\nやめた方が良いです！\n...って言っても学校の自己紹介って\n妙に緊張しちゃうんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長くなってごめんなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年下でも呼び方は\n何でもありですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度の全握で行こうと思うのですが\n名前は何と呼べばいいですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"呼び方に困ったら「まりっか」\nって呼んでください！\n年下とか、年齢なんて関係ないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持っている服のなかで一番\n気に入ってる服はどんな服ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいあるから\n一つに絞れません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々推しだけど握手会で\nまりかに会いに行ってもいい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい。ぜひっ\nねねの相方はこんな感じかあ\nってわかるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかが名字で呼んでる\nメンバーっているのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒！せいたんとひなは\n時々呼び捨て！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもお洋服どこで買ってるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルミネもラフォーレも行く！\nAMBIDEXの服とってもかわいい^^*\n古着屋も行くよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お肉派よりお魚派？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちもすきー\n今は魚よく食べるー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニーとか行かないのｰ?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり自分から\n行こうとしないな。\nねえ、誰か誘って←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段から肩にお洋服\n巻いたりするの？\nあと、春服でどういうのが\n欲しいとかあるのかなー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩にかけるアイディアはママ。\n挑戦しようと思う。\n今狙ってる服あるから\n買いに行きたいなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一発芸は好きですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日村さんのトドすき♪\nFUJIWARAの原西さんの\nギャグもすき！とんち！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト終わって今１番\nやりたいことってなに(^^)？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"整体に行って雑貨屋巡りして\nカフェでまったりしたい。\nそしてガンガンお仕事！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PVに出て来た白熊の名前は\n何て言うの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しろくまりっくまっていいます。\n詳細は295回目の記事に載せてるので\nぜひ見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はちっちゃい頃の\n写真見てました...\nちっちゃい頃の髪型って\nなんでもありだな。ファンキー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1つ目のなんともいえない顔が\n多かったなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2つ目めっちゃ睨んでおる！こわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3つ目、笑ってる！貴重貴重。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤い服いっぱい着てたな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに小さい時もあったんだな。\nあらためておでこ広いな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日も頑張りまりか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま り か"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-h61ebdc5221":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！橋本です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお仕事からの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンでした〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合間に落書きしたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペイっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0000-295.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんごにあげる！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん昨日の深夜に放送されていた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時をかける少女"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観ましたか〜？(o^_^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『未来で待ってる』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわああぁ(T^T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は早いので寝ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もお疲れ様でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい＼(^o^)／"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-39523":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":" こんばんは〜 "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETQ0F8QVS4D2HWYT5108MR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> にゃー "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETQ3HE76KHM1QRM9Z9BDNJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> じゃらんのCMみてね！探して〜   